    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just a way to delay the inevitable. people always say \"it's temporary\" but it feels like a cycle that just keeps repeating. if the cycle is just pain, isn't there a logical point where stopping the cycle is just more rational than continuing to suffer through it?",
